<content>
<callout icon="☎️" color="gray_bg">
	Your job starts the moment a lead submits. Speed-to-lead is your single most important daily habit — intent drops every minute you wait.
</callout>
## 📱 Dialer Platform
**Close CRM built-in dialer.** Your login is provisioned by Daniel when you're onboarded (the CRM build is going live now). Credentials come by DM — never posted in Slack channels, never shared.
---
## 📋 Dialer Rules
- Contact every new lead within 5 minutes of application submission — no exceptions
- Minimum 3 call attempts before moving to SMS-only follow-up
- Never leave a voicemail without also sending an SMS immediately after
- Log every call attempt in Close CRM — time, outcome, next step
- If no answer after 3 attempts: move to SMS sequence and set a follow-up task in CRM
---
## ⚡ Speed-to-Lead Protocol
<callout icon="🚨" color="red_bg">
	Intent drops every minute you wait. This is not optional — it's the difference between a booked call and a dead lead.
</callout>
- Minute 1 — Automated SMS fires immediately after application
- Minute 5 — You call the lead
- Same day — Closer call if qualified
</content>
